msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-letters.php:76
msgid "Checking a letter"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-letters.php:78
msgid "You can check whether a reference somebody has phoned in about still matches this organization's records. Producing a letter is a separate permission — ask an administrator if you need it."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-letters.php:121
