msgid "Activity suggestions"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:278
msgid "One per line. Offered as suggestions when logging a shift; staff can still type anything. Leave empty for free text."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:287
msgid "Plan shifts ahead of time"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:288
msgid "Off until you switch it on. With it on, a Schedule screen appears where you can plan shifts, repeat them, put volunteers on them and print a roster. A scheduled shift is a plan and records nothing about anybody's hours — hours are still logged after the fact and still have to be verified."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:295
msgid "Location suggestions"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:296
